# Google Generative AI key — either name works.
# Powers the vernacular score explanation (EN / HI / TE). Without it the app
# falls back to a deterministic offline explanation; everything else works.
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_key_here
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here

# Optional overrides — both have sane defaults, set them only if you need to.
#
# Where the bundled AgamiAI corpus lives. Defaults to ./src/data/agami.
# AGAMI_DATA_DIR=/app/src/data/agami
#
# Where mutable demo state (loan pipeline, retrain runs) is written.
# Defaults to /tmp/udyamai on Cloud Run and ./.data locally.
# UDYAMAI_DATA_DIR=/tmp/udyamai

# There is no DATABASE_URL. The app has no database — see ARCHITECTURE.md.
